                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">5 SDOH DOMAINS</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"28\">Healthy People 2030 — Social Determinants</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"160\" width=\"420\" height=\"100\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"310\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">1. Economic Stability</text>\n                    <text x=\"310\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Poverty, employment, food security</text>\n                    <rect x=\"580\" y=\"160\" width=\"420\" height=\"100\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"790\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">2. Education Access</text>\n                    <text x=\"790\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Graduation, literacy, language</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"280\" width=\"420\" height=\"100\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"310\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">3. Healthcare Access</text>\n                    <text x=\"310\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Insurance, providers, health literacy</text>\n                    <rect x=\"580\" y=\"280\" width=\"420\" height=\"100\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"790\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">4. Neighborhood/Environment</text>\n                    <text x=\"790\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Housing, transport, food deserts</text>\n                    <rect x=\"300\" y=\"400\" width=\"500\" height=\"100\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">5. Social &amp; Community Context</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Social cohesion, discrimination, ACEs</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"540\" width=\"700\" height=\"100\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">GENETIC PREDISPOSITION = NOT SDOH</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"612\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"14\">Genetics are biological factors, not social/environmental conditions</text>\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"680\" width=\"800\" height=\"70\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.08)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"723\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"18\">SDOH = External conditions where people live, learn, work, and play</text>\n                </svg>",
                    "caption": "Genetic predisposition is a biological factor, not a social determinant of health"
